  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Communication Global Gateway Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this contract is to stimulate a paradigm shift in the way the relationship between the EU and Brazil is portrayed and perceived by the primary target audience. &lt;strong&gt;Make Strategic Communication an integral part of Global Gateway implementation in Brazil&lt;/strong&gt;, to ensure that awareness, understanding and perception of the European Union as a global actor and value driven, reliable partner is commensurate with the scale, scope and ambition of the EU&#xbf;s political commitment and sustained investment. The EU shall be perceived as a reliable and relevant partner of choice for Brazil&#xbf;s inclusive and sustainable growth and get public support for the Global Gateway strategy in Brazil. For the Global Gateway to deliver, the EU&#xbf;s contributions, including through non-high visibility projects, will have to become visible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective (Outcome) of this contract is to measurably increase awareness and positive perception of the EU as a trusted and reliable partner for Brazil, on the issues that matter to young people and around key Global Gateway partnership priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected outputs of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO1 (Outcome 1): Global Gateway Communication Strategy and Plan campaign designed and implemented&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xa7;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1 to Outcome 1: Data gathering and analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xa7;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2 to Outcome 1: Campaign design and planingGlobal Gateway Communication Strategy and Communication Plan Planning, production, placement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xa7;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3 to Outcome 1: Campaign production and implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xa7;&lt;strong&gt;Output 4 to Outcome 1: Monitoring, optimisation and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO2: Specialized political communication:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This section will include those actions that fall outside the scope of the broader Global Gateway campaign. The focus of these communication actions will depend on the delegation&#xbf;s activities, such as the Commissioner&apos;s missions or key moments for the delegation, with the aim of supporting EU awareness regarding its alliance with Brazil.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
